Termes Match is a modified TeX Gyre Termes derivative maintained by Ivana.
Changes: family identity, outline scaling, reference metrics and kerning.
Source and build scripts: https://github.com/IvanaGyro/nimbus-match
The original TeX Gyre maintainers are not responsible for this derivative.

